<HelloFraandsPage title="Age policy" summary="Callers aur hosts, sabhi ka 18 saal ya usse zyada hona zaroori hai." review={false} related={[]}>
<h2>Adults only</h2>
<p>You must be at least 18 to call or host on Hello Fraands. An adult must not let a child use their account.</p>
<h2>How age is checked</h2>
<p>Everyone declares their age at sign-up. Hosts complete Aadhaar verification and video KYC. Callers may need Aadhaar verification once their top-ups reach the verification threshold shown in the payment flow. Do not use another person's details.</p>
<h2>If we find a minor</h2>
<p>We close the account and return its remaining wallet balance to the original payment source. We may ask for information needed to verify the account and process that refund safely.</p>
<p>If you believe a user is under 18, <a href="/report">report the profile or call</a>. Do not ask them to send you identity documents. See our <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a> for how verification results are handled.</p>
</HelloFraandsPage>
